        "content": "## Step 2 — Find Company domain\nUses LinkFinder AI `company_name_to_website`\n\n⚠️ Add your API key:\nhttps://linkfinderai.com → Dashboard → Settings → API Key\n\nResponse Structure: $json.result",
        "height": 600,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 6
      },
