    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 3 — Get Employees\nUses LinkFinder AI `company_domain_to_employees`\n\nReturns all employees with name, title, LinkedIn URL.\n\nResponse Structure: Direct field access\n- $json.name\n- $json.jobTitle\n- $json.company\n- $json.email\n- $json.linkedinUrl\n- $json.headline\n- $json.city, $json.state, $json.country\n\nBatch: 25 per request, 25s interval to respect rate limits.",
